      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;When her land and her cabin are taken over by exiled hybrids, Catra sets off on a journey with her companion Melog to save a princess and get back the home that was taken away from her.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[OR]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Shrek Ã— She-Ra AU no one other than middle school me asked for&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
